   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( P_2(x) \\) be the Taylor polynomial of degree 2 for a function f about \\( x = 2 \\). For all x in the interval \\( \\frac{3}{2} \\le x \\le 2 \\), \\( \\left|f^{(3)}(x)\\right| \\le 7 \\). Use the Lagrange error bound to find an upper bound for \\( \\left|f(\\frac{3}{2}) - P_2(\\frac{3}{2})\\right| \\).",
