      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The Lagrange error bound is \\( \\left|f(\\frac{3}{2}) - P_2(\\frac{3}{2})\\right| \\le \\frac{M}{3!} \\left|\\frac{3}{2} - 2\\right|^{3} \\).",
